            "text": "Which of the following best paraphrases the underlined sentence in paragraph 1?\n<i>“Faced with heavy clay soil that made modern arable farming persistently unprofitable, owners Charlie Burrell and Isabella Tree took the radical decision in 2001 to sell their tractors and hand the land back to nature.”</i>",
