            "text": "Which of the following best paraphrases the underlined sentence in paragraph 1?\n<i>“Eliminated from the northern Rockies for nearly seven decades, the grey wolf returned in 1995 and triggered an ecological transformation that textbooks now call a classic trophic cascade.”</i>",
